  "key_path": "TwoFactorAuthMobileDescription",
  "content": "Two-factor authentication is a more secure way for the users to enter the workspace. After the credentials are entered, the user will have to enter the code from the SMS received to the mobile phone with the number which was specified at the first workspace login or the code from an authentication application.",
